WEBVTT

01:36.320 --> 01:39.780
APOCALYPSE INSIDE TAINTED SOIL

01:39.780 --> 01:53.550
OKAKI

01:40.870 --> 01:42.950
To stop the introduction of CLONE COPS,

01:42.950 --> 01:47.830
Nancy offers to trade information regarding
an antidote for the NINJA anti-virus TAKEUCHI

01:47.830 --> 01:53.550
in exchange for NINJA Slayer's help sneaking into a Yoroshisan Pharmaceuticals bio-plant.

01:54.760 --> 01:56.920
I heard you had a map.

01:57.970 --> 01:59.390
When did you get here?

02:00.720 --> 02:02.390
I see.

02:02.390 --> 02:04.100
So that OKAKI plant...

02:04.600 --> 02:06.480
The intel's good.

02:06.480 --> 02:07.940
You don't have to tell me.

02:10.150 --> 02:14.980
Those are NN-445s, usually given to the coastal security forces.

02:15.320 --> 02:18.530
And look at their faces.

02:18.530 --> 02:19.990
CLONE YAKUZA, right?

02:19.990 --> 02:21.410
Correct.

02:21.410 --> 02:24.950
A simple OKAKI plant, guarded by the latest model of CLONE YAKUZA,

02:24.950 --> 02:27.370
the Y-12, and armed with top-of-the-line guns?

02:27.910 --> 02:28.920
Impossible.

02:31.460 --> 02:33.540
Wait here. I'll take care of this.

02:38.550 --> 02:39.510
YEEART!

02:38.930 --> 02:39.760
UWAAH!

02:43.470 --> 02:44.640
AARGH!

02:45.180 --> 02:46.600
I heard a noise.

02:46.600 --> 02:47.640
What was it?

02:47.640 --> 02:48.770
I don't know.

02:48.770 --> 02:50.190
I’ll go look.

02:53.400 --> 02:54.570
YEEART!

02:53.770 --> 02:54.570
BWAAH!

02:55.270 --> 02:56.280
YEEART!

02:56.280 --> 02:58.360
GWAAAGH!

02:58.360 --> 02:58.990
YEEART!

02:58.990 --> 03:00.610
UWAAAH!

03:00.610 --> 03:01.570
YEEART!

03:06.080 --> 03:07.450
You finished them off, right?

03:08.500 --> 03:09.500
YEEART!

03:10.420 --> 03:12.130
We'll sneak in the back way.

03:17.340 --> 03:17.380
Break Room

03:18.420 --> 03:19.470
This is the place.

03:23.260 --> 03:27.680
With the power of his NINJA grip, it broke as easily as a SHŌJI door!

03:27.680 --> 03:28.730
YEEART!

03:32.440 --> 03:36.230
Go Home On Time

03:38.570 --> 03:41.400
The information's been good so far.

03:42.780 --> 03:44.700
Right 4.

03:44.700 --> 03:46.740
Left 6.

03:47.540 --> 03:49.330
Right 4.

03:49.870 --> 03:52.920
And then left 3.

03:58.760 --> 04:00.090
It was an elevator!

04:02.300 --> 04:05.390
Doors opening soon!

04:05.800 --> 04:06.890
Get ready.

04:07.260 --> 04:09.430
Doors opening!

04:13.480 --> 04:15.100
What a sight!

04:15.100 --> 04:22.820
Who could have known that tiny OKAKI factory concealed a huge facility like this?

04:23.320 --> 04:25.780
How... How horrible!

04:26.910 --> 04:29.790
So these are the source of the life signs?

04:29.790 --> 04:39.050
YOROSHISAN

04:29.790 --> 04:32.250
Oh! NAMU AMIDA BUTSU!

04:32.250 --> 04:33.710
How unspeakable!

04:33.710 --> 04:39.050
The two of them were looking down into a CLONE YAKUZA factory!

04:39.670 --> 04:44.050
If our information is right, the CLONE COPS are just up ahead.

04:39.670 --> 04:44.050
NOTE: See? YAKUZA VATS, just like we said.

04:44.050 --> 04:46.800
I'll head to the monitor room's computer...

04:50.520 --> 04:52.230
...and plug in is memory stick.

04:52.230 --> 04:54.480
That will install the virus program.

04:54.480 --> 04:58.900
It'll steal the information on the TANUKI, too.

04:54.480 --> 04:58.900
NOTE: TANUKI have enormous TESTICLES.

05:05.820 --> 05:12.120
Her plan may seem simplistic, but her goal is to uncover a far deeper conspiracy.

05:12.120 --> 05:13.660
TANUKI

05:12.830 --> 05:15.370
The TANUKI.

05:15.370 --> 05:19.920
Very Secret

05:15.370 --> 05:19.920
Top Secret, We Mean It

05:21.750 --> 05:33.720
yo=4 ro=6 shi=4 san=3 ya=8 ku=9 za=3

05:28.430 --> 05:33.720
This terrifying password shows the link between Yoroshisan and the SŌKAI YAKUZA!

05:34.100 --> 05:36.440
Opening.

05:48.530 --> 05:51.530
Are they all CLONE COPS?

05:48.910 --> 05:52.620
Cop Thinking Routines Patented
By Yoroshisan

05:52.620 --> 05:54.080
NAMU SAN!

05:54.080 --> 05:58.420
If this many CLONE COPS infiltrate the security organizations of Neo-Saitama,

05:58.420 --> 06:01.340
a dark future awaits us all!

06:01.880 --> 06:03.710
Nancy-SAN.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.420
MONITOR ROOM ADMINISTRATION

06:03.710 --> 06:05.420
Is that it?

06:06.090 --> 06:06.720
YEEART!

06:06.720 --> 06:07.300
HIYAH!

06:10.760 --> 06:12.970
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE.

06:12.970 --> 06:14.930
I am Forest SAW ATARI.

06:15.470 --> 06:17.310
DŌMO, Forest-san.

06:18.140 --> 06:19.940
I am NINJA Slayer.

06:22.190 --> 06:25.860
I see. I thought security here was lax.

06:25.860 --> 06:28.320
Is it because a NINJA defends this place?

06:28.320 --> 06:31.030
But your luck ran out when you met me.

06:31.700 --> 06:33.530
NINJAS must be slain!

06:33.870 --> 06:37.040
NINJA Slayer is quite a strange name.

06:37.960 --> 06:44.000
Behold! In just a short time, her body had been tightly bound by metallic ropes!

06:49.970 --> 06:53.430
You seem to have the wrong idea.

06:53.800 --> 06:57.020
I'm not part of Yoroshisan's security force.

06:57.020 --> 06:59.440
In fact, I just quit my job.

06:59.440 --> 07:01.190
What?

07:01.190 --> 07:05.610
You should thank me for cleaning up the guards on your way here.

07:06.690 --> 07:11.240
So that’s why we could make it through the plant so easily?

07:11.240 --> 07:13.950
I don't care about you.

07:13.950 --> 07:15.200
But...

07:15.200 --> 07:19.410
I think I'm taking this pretty girl home and making her my wife.

07:19.410 --> 07:20.540
Move.

07:20.960 --> 07:22.290
I refuse.

07:22.290 --> 07:25.800
YEEART!

07:31.180 --> 07:32.300
It's useless!

07:32.300 --> 07:35.890
Bio-BAMBOO is four times as strong as steel!

07:35.890 --> 07:37.310
WASSHOI!

07:37.680 --> 07:39.140
YEEART!

07:46.520 --> 07:49.440
The arrows were tipped with some kind of poison!

07:46.520 --> 07:49.440
NOTE: It was probably NINJA POISON.

07:49.440 --> 07:51.280
YEEART!

07:53.660 --> 07:56.620
This isn't getting us anywhere, is it, Forest-SAN?

07:56.620 --> 07:58.490
Show me your next trick.

07:58.870 --> 08:01.660
You don't need to ask.

08:02.710 --> 08:05.210
Tell me, have you heard of Saigon?

08:05.210 --> 08:08.880
I'll show you a glimpse of the hell of 'Nam!

08:08.880 --> 08:12.430
The memories of his NINJA SOUL had begun to seep into Forest's mind!

08:12.680 --> 08:14.140
It was a dangerous situation!

08:14.140 --> 08:15.550
YEEART!

08:19.810 --> 08:20.930
GUWAAAAGH!

08:20.930 --> 08:22.230
NAMU SAN!

08:22.230 --> 08:26.060
This is a DARK KARATE technique, the somersault kick!

08:27.310 --> 08:27.820
YEEART!

08:27.820 --> 08:28.980
UWAAAAGHH!

08:36.490 --> 08:37.700
UWAAAAAAAAGGHHHHH!

08:45.000 --> 08:46.250
The battle is over.

08:46.250 --> 08:48.750
Hurry. There's no telling what else might happen.

08:49.380 --> 08:50.590
You're right.

08:51.420 --> 08:52.720
Prepare to suffer KAISHAKU!

08:57.470 --> 09:00.260
Our boss is so lame sometimes.

09:00.680 --> 09:04.230
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE. I am FROGMAN.

09:04.230 --> 09:07.150
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE.

09:07.150 --> 09:09.360
I am DISTURBED.

09:13.990 --> 09:17.490
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE.
I am NINJA Slayer.

09:19.490 --> 09:22.290
I'll call you after I've killed them all.

09:22.580 --> 09:25.080
I don't care about the girl.

09:25.080 --> 09:27.710
She's got nothing to do with me.

09:28.420 --> 09:31.500
I just want to prove the strength of my bio-blades!

09:28.420 --> 09:31.500
NOTE: Bio-blades are organically sourced.

09:42.100 --> 09:46.310
Just sit back and see how amazing my bio-blades are!

09:46.310 --> 09:48.100
YEEART!

09:53.280 --> 09:55.280
GUWAAAAAH!

09:55.950 --> 09:57.280
YEEART!

10:08.460 --> 10:09.460
You're mine!

10:10.000 --> 10:11.790
MARPUTATSU!

10:12.800 --> 10:14.380
GUWAAARGH!

10:14.380 --> 10:17.130
Two against one isn't fair, is it?

10:17.130 --> 10:18.260
You bitch...

10:18.260 --> 10:19.390
A fatal error!

10:19.390 --> 10:20.050
YEEART!

10:20.050 --> 10:21.180
UWAAAAGHH!

10:22.350 --> 10:23.680
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU!

10:23.680 --> 10:27.140
This is the DARK KARATE technique, the body check!

10:29.400 --> 10:30.520
IAIDŌ!

10:33.400 --> 10:36.030
GOTCHA!

10:37.150 --> 10:39.160
Above you, NOTORIOUS-SAN!

10:42.740 --> 10:43.700
YEEART!

10:43.700 --> 10:45.700
UWAAAAGHH!

10:46.500 --> 10:48.000
Prepare to suffer KAISHAKU.

10:46.500 --> 10:48.000
NOTE: KAISHAKU is NINJA head loss.

10:48.000 --> 10:51.380
Using MIGAWARI? You coward...!

10:53.420 --> 10:54.210
Again?

10:54.800 --> 10:57.720
I know so much about your karate now that it hurts.

10:58.010 --> 11:00.720
We'll fight another time.

11:00.720 --> 11:01.970
Who are you?

11:01.970 --> 11:04.890
Are you Yoroshisan NINJA?

11:04.890 --> 11:07.980
We were, I suppose I should say.

11:09.230 --> 11:13.610
From now on, we're the Survivor DŌJŌ!

11:14.020 --> 11:15.110
SURVIVOR DOJO

11:15.570 --> 11:18.650
We're bio-NINJA test subjects!

11:18.940 --> 11:24.120
But taking orders from those weak scientists is stupid.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.330
So we're quitting our jobs!

11:27.330 --> 11:28.540
Freedom!

11:32.040 --> 11:34.790
And so we've gotta go pick up one more of us.

11:35.040 --> 11:39.760
He's asleep down below.

11:40.050 --> 11:43.470
You're not after us, are you?

11:43.470 --> 11:46.010
Want to fight and keep an eye on her?

11:49.520 --> 11:52.600
I can take your silence as my answer, right?

11:52.600 --> 11:54.360
Very well.

11:54.360 --> 11:56.440
Farewell!

12:02.910 --> 12:04.910
Anyway, we're done here.

12:04.910 --> 12:07.620
The virus program has changed the genetic blueprint

12:07.620 --> 12:10.330
of the CLONE COPS and CLONE YAKUZA.

12:10.330 --> 12:13.370
Yoroshisan's plans are ruined for now.

12:13.370 --> 12:15.330
Glad to hear it.

12:15.630 --> 12:18.800
So give me the data you promised, Nancy-SAN.

12:18.800 --> 12:21.130
All I've done so far is obtain the data.

12:21.380 --> 12:23.340
I still need to analyze it.

12:23.340 --> 12:24.760
Trust me.
